{"logId": "ae82e3db-0ef9-4725-a273-5bb0599c907d", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——理财", "block_bbox": [364, 121, 787, 164], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[364.0, 121.0], [787.0, 121.0], [787.0, 164.0], [364.0, 164.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "三级【2~3分】：不让欲望大于能力，能够合理地支配收入，有正确、理性的金钱观，知足常乐。（由生存走向生活）", "block_bbox": [360, 230, 1604, 307], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[360.0, 230.0], [1604.0, 230.0], [1604.0, 307.0], [360.0, 307.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：对个人或家庭的收入状况满意且知足，能够做到合理地规划和支配，不过多给予家人经济方面的照顾，并有一定的抗风险能力，不因一般的外在因素让自己或家庭处于紧张、窘迫的地步，能够轻松地创造和享受生活、享受品质。", "block_bbox": [362, 342, 1609, 463], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[362.0, 342.0], [1609.0, 342.0], [1609.0, 463.0], [362.0, 463.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [364, 499, 535, 531], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[364.0, 499.0], [535.0, 499.0], [535.0, 531.0], [364.0, 531.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、没有相互借款，能力范围内享受生活", "block_bbox": [389, 550, 859, 582], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 550.0], [859.0, 550.0], [859.0, 582.0], [389.0, 582.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、日常给予双方父母的照顾不超过收入的10%", "block_bbox": [388, 593, 941, 625], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[388.0, 593.0], [941.0, 593.0], [941.0, 625.0], [388.0, 625.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、除父母外给予家人、亲戚等帮助不超过收入的10%", "block_bbox": [388, 636, 1019, 668], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[388.0, 636.0], [1019.0, 636.0], [1019.0, 668.0], [388.0, 668.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、科学、合理的储蓄，除了预设储备资金，注重提升和享受生活品质", "block_bbox": [389, 679, 1202, 711], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 679.0], [1202.0, 679.0], [1202.0, 711.0], [389.0, 711.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）根据收入水平和工作年限科学、合理地规划储蓄。短期内优先解决居家、家庭等问题，可不储蓄（5年内）。长期工作之后可循序渐进的累积，每个级别达到预期储备资金，保障应急问题处理后，更多资金要注重提升和享受生活品质！", "block_bbox": [389, 723, 1610, 841], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[389.0, 723.0], [1610.0, 723.0], [1610.0, 841.0], [389.0, 841.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）长期预储备资金：员工20万及以下、班长30万及以下、课级50万及以下、处级80万及以下、店级200万及以下", "block_bbox": [387, 852, 1607, 928], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[387.0, 852.0], [1607.0, 852.0], [1607.0, 928.0], [387.0, 928.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[79]", "block_bbox": [968, 970, 1019, 996], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[968.0, 970.0], [1018.0, 970.0], [1018.0, 995.0], [968.0, 995.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8163560032844543, "coordinate": [364, 121, 787, 164], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[364.0, 121.0], [787.0, 121.0], [787.0, 164.0], [364.0, 164.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.9117334485054016, "coordinate": [360, 230, 1604, 307], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[360.0, 230.0], [1604.0, 230.0], [1604.0, 307.0], [360.0, 307.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9461618065834045, "coordinate": [362, 342, 1609, 463], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[362.0, 342.0], [1609.0, 342.0], [1609.0, 463.0], [362.0, 463.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7710759043693542, "coordinate": [364, 499, 535, 531], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[364.0, 499.0], [535.0, 499.0], [535.0, 531.0], [364.0, 531.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8173565864562988, "coordinate": [389, 550, 859, 582], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[389.0, 550.0], [859.0, 550.0], [859.0, 582.0], [389.0, 582.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8241592645645142, "coordinate": [388, 593, 941, 625], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[388.0, 593.0], [941.0, 593.0], [941.0, 625.0], [388.0, 625.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.836980938911438, "coordinate": [388, 636, 1019, 668], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[388.0, 636.0], [1019.0, 636.0], [1019.0, 668.0], [388.0, 668.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8569520711898804, "coordinate": [389, 679, 1202, 711], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[389.0, 679.0], [1202.0, 679.0], [1202.0, 711.0], [389.0, 711.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9542201161384583, "coordinate": [389, 723, 1610, 841], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[389.0, 723.0], [1610.0, 723.0], [1610.0, 841.0], [389.0, 841.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9286202192306519, "coordinate": [387, 852, 1607, 928], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[387.0, 852.0], [1607.0, 852.0], [1607.0, 928.0], [387.0, 928.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7716041803359985, "coordinate": [968, 970, 1019, 996], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[968.0, 970.0], [1018.0, 970.0], [1018.0, 995.0], [968.0, 995.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——理财\n\n## 三 级【2~3分】：不让欲望大于能力，能够合理地支配收入，有正确、理性的金钱观，知足常乐。（由生存走向生活）\n\n- 本条释义：对个人或家庭的收入状况满意且知足，能够做到合理地规划和支配，不过多给予家人经济方面的照顾，并有一定的抗风险能力，不因一般的外在因素让自己或家庭处于紧张、窘迫的地步，能够轻松地创造和享受生活、享受品质。\n\n## 符合的行为：\n\n1、没有相互借款，能力范围内享受生活\n\n2、日常给予双方父母的照顾不超过收入的10%\n\n3、除父母外给予家人、亲戚等帮助不超过收入的10%\n\n4、科学、合理的储蓄，除了预设储备资金，注重提升和享受生活品质\n\n（1）根据收入水平和工作年限科学、合理地规划储蓄。短期内优先解决居家、家庭等问题，可不储蓄（5年内）。长期工作之后可循序渐进的累积，每个级别达到预期储备资金，保障应急问题处理后，更多资金要注重提升和享受生活品质！\n\n（2）长期预储备资金：员工20万及以下、班长30万及以下、课级50万及以下、处级80万及以下、店级200万及以下", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ae82e3db-0ef9-4725-a273-5bb0599c907d/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A40%3A37Z%2F-1%2F%2F6c5b07c3bf80e84f5358b14ce425bd3cc2a37136e6ae4f11b692d35c76b6eb7d"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ae82e3db-0ef9-4725-a273-5bb0599c907d/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A40%3A38Z%2F-1%2F%2F7bbf52ad8d15657193e44fb4f6be8d72ae83dfdaaadbe58a07c04cd7b2f5c94d"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ae82e3db-0ef9-4725-a273-5bb0599c907d/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A40%3A39Z%2F-1%2F%2F23bb9ea5427042e2b10de84b3e8a055e6e8226d31b9d4039ee8954390283b289"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
